**Card (Listing)**
```css
.listing { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease; }
.listing:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
